    class Order {
        -String orderId
        -List~String~ items
        -double totalAmount
        -String paymentTransactionId
        -String trackingNumber
        -String cancellationReason
        -OrderState currentState
        +Order(String orderId)
        +addItem(String itemName, double price) void
        +pay(String paymentTxId) void
        +ship(String trackingNumber) void
        +deliver() void
        +cancel(String reason) void
        +refund() void
        +setState(OrderState state) void
        +getCurrentState() OrderState
        +getTotalAmount() double
    }

    OrderState <|.. CreatedOrderState : implements
    OrderState <|.. PaidOrderState : implements
    OrderState <|.. ShippedOrderState : implements
    OrderState <|.. DeliveredOrderState : implements
    OrderState <|.. CancelledOrderState : implements

    Order o--> OrderState : delegates to currentState
    CreatedOrderState ..> Order : transitions
    PaidOrderState ..> Order : transitions
